<title>nasir-claude-chat-qa-status-nov17-v3</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>:root{color-scheme:light only;supported-color-schemes:light}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F1F3F4">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F1F3F4" style="background-color:#F1F3F4">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Nasir,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Thank you for sharing the Claude chat conversation: <a href="https://claude.ai/share/ee4365be-afae-4e52-bac2-151b024d26c0" style="color:#2E4A66;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#AFC0D1;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:normal">https://claude.ai/share/ee4365be-afae-4e52-bac2-151b024d26c0</a></p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">It helped me understand the missing key parts, along with the GHL connection to calendar protocols. I passed the chat and that context to Mr Abaiyaz, and it is now urgent tier priority.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Back-to-back QA sessions run today, Tuesday, November 17 (PST). Whether or not the functionality and tests pass, you will have a confirmed status update by Wednesday, November 18 (PST), based on today&#x27;s QA results.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">TLDR of the shared chat</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The ask: an automated system in Claude that tracks team tasks and follow-ups from G Suite email and sends reminders, so due dates are not missed.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The design: Gmail intake with an &quot;Action&quot; label, a Google Sheet as the task record (Pending, Active, Log, Team tabs), and a scheduled Claude run on weekday mornings. The run flags overdue and due-soon tasks, checks threads for replies, and sends a digest.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The limit built into the chat&#x27;s own prompt: &quot;Never send email. Drafts only.&quot; Claude writes reminders and follow-ups as drafts, and a person sends them. A person also approves each new task before it becomes active.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The requirement before it runs: each team member connects their own Gmail and Google Sheets in their own Claude account through Google OAuth. One shared account cannot read everyone&#x27;s mail. The Workspace admin must also allow third-party apps and the Gmail and Sheets permissions, and the chat says it could not verify that.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The chat&#x27;s rollout: week 1 manual intake and review, week 2 daily digest with drafts, week 3 consider automatic reminders.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">The flow, step by step</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Highlighted steps need a person. The other steps Claude does.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">1 · Confirm the Workspace admin allows third-party apps and the Gmail and Sheets permissions</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Nasir</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">2 · Create the Team Tracker sheet (Active, Pending, Log, Team tabs) and share it as Editor with each member</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Nasir</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">3 · Create the Gmail label &quot;Action&quot; (by hand or with a filter)</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Nasir</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">4 · Connect Gmail and Google Sheets in their own Claude account and approve the permissions</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Each team member</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">5 · Run the per-user prompt once by hand. Check that drafts land in Drafts and nothing sends</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Each team member</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">6 · Schedule the daily run, weekdays, staggered by person, with both connectors left on</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Each team member</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">7 · Email labeled &quot;Action&quot; arrives. Claude extracts task, owner and due date into the Pending tab</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Claude</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">8 · Review about 2 minutes a day: approve or edit, and the item moves to Active</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Nasir</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">9 · Daily run: classifies tasks, checks threads for replies, drafts reminders and follow-ups (drafts only)</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Claude</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">10 · Digest arrives. Each person reviews the drafts and sends them</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Each team member</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">11 · Owner replies &quot;done&quot; or the task is marked complete. Claude updates the Sheet and logs it</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Claude</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
